READING:
  Fine-tuning improves on the stock predictor by 0.1264 MSE with no
  signals at all. That gain is domain adaptation, not behavioural conditioning —
  it is the part of the effect the ladder was built to separate out.
  The choice of no-signal baseline moves the number MORE than gaze does. Any Delta
  quoted without naming its baseline is uninterpretable — which is what happened
  to the +0.0011.
